      <data key="d3">32702224</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
      <data key="d7">Clozapine is the most effective antipsychotic for treatment resistant schizophrenia but adverse reactions to clozapine include neutropenia.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
