    <node id="publication:35288577">
      <data key="d1">publication</data>
      <data key="d2">PMID 35288577</data>
      <data key="d3">35288577</data>
      <data key="d4">Distinctive pattern of neutrophil count change in clozapine-associated, life-threatening agranulocytosis.</data>
      <data key="d5">2022 Mar 14</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:35288577:1:00108">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">supported evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">35288577</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
      <data key="d7">The wider use of clozapine is limited by the risk of agranulocytosis and the associated requirement for monitoring of neutrophil counts.</data>
      <data key="d8">supported</data>
      <data key="d9">[{"type": "risk_language", "text": "risk of", "start": 45, "end": 52}]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">3.949862763670301</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:35288577:2:00109">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">35288577</data>
      <data key="d6">2</data>
      <data key="d7">We searched local electronic patient records for cases of agranulocytosis occurring during clozapine treatment during the period 2007-2020.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">3.949862763670301</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:35288577:3:00110">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">35288577</data>
      <data key="d6">3</data>
      <data key="d7">We found 23 episodes recorded as agranulocytosis in clozapine patients.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">3.949862763670301</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:35288577:9:00111">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">35288577</data>
      <data key="d6">9</data>
      <data key="d7">We conclude that an important proportion of cases of agranulocytosis identified in people prescribed clozapine are not life-threatening and may not even be clozapine-related.</data>
