      <data key="d6">8</data>
      <data key="d7">FINDINGS: Among 12,810 new users, isolated minor neutropenia occurred at 10.5 per 1000 person-years, and serious neutropenia leading to clozapine cessation at 1.7 per 1000 person-years.</data>
