      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">27168101</data>
      <data key="d6">2</data>
      <data key="d7">The aim of this study was to identify genetic risk factors in a population of 310 Dutch patients treated with clozapine, including 38 patients developing neutropenia and 31 patients developing agranulocytosis.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
