      <data key="d6">10</data>
      <data key="d7">Patients who discontinued clozapine due to neutropenia were more likely to be of black ethnicity (OR 2.99, p&lt;0.001), were younger (t=5.86, df=267, p&lt;0.001), and received lower doses of clozapine (t=-2.587, p=0.01) than those who did not develop neutropenia.</data>
