      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">27232877</data>
      <data key="d6">3</data>
      <data key="d7">We analyzed all the reports, from the database of the pharmacovigilance department of the Argentine National Administration of Drugs, Foods, and Medical Devices, of patients who were rechallenged with clozapine after a leucopenia or a neutropenia.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
