      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">27232877</data>
      <data key="d6">8</data>
      <data key="d7">The present study shows that almost 70% of the patients rechallenged with clozapine after a leucopenia or a neutropenia did not develop a new hematological adverse effect, whereas the remaining 30% had a faster but less serious neutropenia.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
