      <data key="d3">40302427</data>
      <data key="d6">11</data>
      <data key="d7">Significant differences were found between individuals who discontinued clozapine and those who did not for the longest ANC gap category (p&lt;0.001), neutropenia category (p=0.042), and duration of clozapine use (p=0.001).</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
