      <data key="d3">40302427</data>
      <data key="d6">12</data>
      <data key="d7">CONCLUSIONS: Less frequent ANC monitoring as a consequence of the COVID-19 pandemic did not lead to increased incidence of clozapine discontinuation due to severe neutropenia.</data>
