      <data key="d3">41137791</data>
      <data key="d6">3</data>
      <data key="d7">Considering the FDA decision, the purpose of this study was to examine the prevalence and patient-level factors associated with clozapine-associated neutropenia in a large, diverse, US-based integrated health system.</data>
