      <data key="d3">41137791</data>
      <data key="d6">6</data>
      <data key="d7">The main outcome was any neutropenic event within two years of clozapine initiation, classified as mild (ANC = 1000-1499/μL) or severe (ANC &lt; 1000/μL).</data>
