      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">23510445</data>
      <data key="d6">15</data>
      <data key="d7">Despite these high rates of neutropenia, all but one of the patients with neutropenia during hospitalization were successfully discharged on clozapine.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
