      <data key="d3">34483771</data>
      <data key="d6">4</data>
      <data key="d7">He had experienced two previous trials of clozapine; although he had significant response in the past, both trials ended in neutropenia and an absolute neutrophil count &lt;500 cells per microliter, despite the second trial also including supplemental "as-needed" doses of pegfilgrastim to manage decline in neutrophil counts.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
