      <data key="d3">32544078</data>
      <data key="d6">10</data>
      <data key="d7">Clozapine treatment monitoring protocol applied at special settings, e.g., Clozapine Clinics, is highly beneficial, since the risk of neutropenia, agronulocytosis is minimized, while suicidal behavior and substance use are reduced along with risky health behaviors, i.e., nicotine use and sedentary lifestyle.</data>
