      <data key="d3">16631295</data>
      <data key="d6">2</data>
      <data key="d7">Olanzapine has structural pharmacological similarities to those of clozapine and reports about haematological adverse effects of olanzapine include three groups: the first group includes cases of olanzapine-induced neutropenia, the second informing that olanzapine is safe after clozapine induced agranulocytosis and the third group forms prolongation of clozapine-induced leukopenia with olanzapine use.</data>
