      <data key="d3">35890117</data>
      <data key="d6">2</data>
      <data key="d7">Serious and even life-threatening adverse effects, mostly granulocytopenia, myocarditis, and constipation, are of great clinical concern and constitute a barrier to prescribing clozapine, thus depriving many eligible patients of a lifesaving treatment option.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
