      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">35890117</data>
      <data key="d6">6</data>
      <data key="d7">Our findings indicate that EEG slowing, obsessive-compulsive symptoms, heart rate variability, hyperinsulinemia, metabolic syndrome, and constipation correlate to plasma clozapine levels, whereas QTc, myocarditis, sudden death, leucopenia, neutropenia, sialorrhea, are rather unrelated.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
