      <data key="d3">31094900</data>
      <data key="d6">2</data>
      <data key="d7">Our aim was to evaluate the risk of clozapine-associated neutropenia in a Chilean cohort using the last Food and Drug Administration's recommendations for clozapine monitoring.</data>
