    </node>
    <node id="evidence:24975932:9:00501">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">supported evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">24975932</data>
      <data key="d6">9</data>
      <data key="d7">Clozapine and olanzapine have the safest therapeutic effect, while the side effect of neutropenia must be controlled by 3 weekly blood controls.</data>
      <data key="d8">supported</data>
      <data key="d9">[{"type": "adverse_effect_wording", "text": "side effect", "start": 71, "end": 82}]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">4.379310388184409</data>
    </node>
    <node id="publication:27109327">
      <data key="d1">publication</data>
      <data key="d2">PMID 27109327</data>
      <data key="d3">27109327</data>
      <data key="d4">[Clozapine rechallenge after neutropenia in resistant schizophrenia: A review].</data>
      <data key="d5">2016 Aug</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:27109327:10:00502">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">27109327</data>
      <data key="d6">10</data>
      <data key="d7">RESULTS: These past years, clozapine have been rechallenged successfully after neutropenia thanks to different procedures, the different options being simple rechallenge, rechallenge with lithium and/or rechallenge with G-CSF.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">4.379310388184409</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:27109327:11:00503">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">27109327</data>
      <data key="d6">11</data>
      <data key="d7">Lithium as G-CSF are used to increase neutrophil blood rate and prevent neutropenia recurrence after clozapine rechallenge.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">4.379310388184409</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:27109327:12:00504">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">supported evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">27109327</data>
      <data key="d6">12</data>
      <data key="d7">G-CSF was first used within the context of chemotherapy and extends now to clozapine-induced neutropenia.</data>
      <data key="d8">supported</data>
      <data key="d9">[{"type": "causal_wording", "text": "induced", "start": 85, "end": 92}]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">4.379310388184409</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:27109327:16:00505">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">27109327</data>
      <data key="d6">16</data>
      <data key="d7">First, clozapine is more likely to be incriminated in neutropenia when patients receive many drugs, but a careful study could prevent some discontinuation.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[{"kind": "speculation", "text": "likely", "start": 25, "end": 31}, {"kind": "speculation", "text": "could", "start": 120, "end": 125}]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">4.379310388184409</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:27109327:20:00506">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">27109327</data>
      <data key="d6">20</data>
      <data key="d7">That is why, in Great Britain, a subgroup of patients "benign ethnic neutropenia" has been introduced to enlarge threshold and allow these patients to access clozapine despite lower blood counts.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">4.379310388184409</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:27109327:28:00507">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">27109327</data>
      <data key="d6">28</data>
      <data key="d7">Some publications highlight that if neutropenia occurs on rechallenge, it will do so more quickly and more severe than at the time of initial trial of clozapine.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">4.379310388184409</data>
    </node>
