      <data key="d3">17170061</data>
      <data key="d6">9</data>
      <data key="d7">We concur with recent recommendations to acknowledge differences in WBC values in African Americans and to modify prescribing guidelines or formally acknowledge benign ethnic leucopenia like in other countries in order to facilitate greater use of clozapine in these patients.</data>
