    <node id="evidence:32420002:6:00535">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">32420002</data>
      <data key="d6">6</data>
      <data key="d7">RESULTS: Reporting rates for agranulocytosis, granulocytopenia, leukopenia, and neutropenia with clozapine all increased from the pre-REMS to post-REMS time frames, ranging from a 2-fold increase with leukopenia to a 40-fold increase with neutropenia; the composite measure of all hematologic reports had a 12-fold increase.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
