      <data key="d7">METHOD: Outcomes were studied in patients rechallenged with clozapine at a tertiary referral center between January 2007 and December 2013, following 1 or more previous trials terminated due to neutropenia, defined as an absolute neutrophil count (ANC) &lt; 1.5 × 10(9)/L.</data>
