      <data key="d3">32082940</data>
      <data key="d6">2</data>
      <data key="d7">The use of clozapine can lead to neutropenia, as well as the development of NMS; thus, it seemed logical to explore a possible common genetic background for the development of these two adverse effects.</data>
      <data key="d8">speculative</data>
      <data key="d9">[{"type": "causal_wording", "text": "lead to", "start": 25, "end": 32}]</data>
