      <data key="d6">5</data>
      <data key="d7">The 4 clozapine boxed warnings were associated with 534 fatal outcomes (218 with severe neutropenia, 131 with seizures, 125 with orthostasis, 36 with myocarditis, 24 with cardiomyopathy, and 0 with mitral valve prolapse).</data>
      <data key="d8">supported</data>
      <data key="d9">[{"type": "associated", "text": "associated with", "start": 36, "end": 51}]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
