      <data key="d3">24690066</data>
      <data key="d6">6</data>
      <data key="d7">CONCLUSION: The outcome of this case supports the notion that clinicians could consider introducing clozapine in treatment-refractory patients who have a history of quetiapine XR-induced neutropenia, with close blood monitoring.</data>
