      <data key="d3">18475227</data>
      <data key="d6">4</data>
      <data key="d7">There have been several reports documenting the successful continuation of clozapine in spite of neutropenia by adding granulocyte colony-stimulating factors such as filgrastim.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
