      <data key="d6">5</data>
      <data key="d7">Clozapine concentration and duration of treatment were also found to be relevant contributors to changes in hematological parameters. &lt;b&gt;Conclusions&lt;/b&gt;: These findings suggest that individual antioxidant capacity, particularly involving glutathione metabolism, may influence susceptibility to clozapine-related neutropenia.</data>
