      <data key="d3">42903121</data>
      <data key="d6">11</data>
      <data key="d7">Given AB's extensive previous history of management on clozapine without previous haematological disturbance and ongoing decline in mental state, coupled with the timeline of symptoms 4 days after the administration of chemotherapy agents associated with neutropenia, namely, carboplatin, the decision was taken to reinstate clozapine.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
