      <data key="d3">42903121</data>
      <data key="d6">15</data>
      <data key="d7">The presence of neutropenia in clozapine patients may lead to diagnostic overshadowing and delay the diagnosis of the underlying cause of neutropenia, resulting in delays to treatment as well as unnecessary cessation of clozapine and risk of relapse.</data>
