      <data key="d3">33703870</data>
      <data key="d6">13</data>
      <data key="d7">CONCLUSION: These data strongly suggest that mild neutropenia in the acute phase of COVID-19 in patients who are well established on clozapine is more likely to be a consequence of the virus than of clozapine treatment.</data>
