    <node id="publication:22113154">
      <data key="d1">publication</data>
      <data key="d2">PMID 22113154</data>
      <data key="d3">22113154</data>
      <data key="d4">When can patients with potentially life-threatening adverse effects be rechallenged with clozapine? A systematic review of the published literature.</data>
      <data key="d5">2012 Feb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:22113154:6:00782">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">22113154</data>
      <data key="d6">6</data>
      <data key="d7">RESULTS: Altogether, 138 patients (mean age: 36.3years, 65.7% male, 57.6% Caucasian, virtually all with schizophrenia spectrum diagnosis) underwent clozapine rechallenge after developing neutropenia (n=112), agranulocytosis (n=15), neuroleptic malignant syndrome (NMS) (n=5), myocarditis (n=4), pericarditis (n=1) and lupus erythematosus (n=1).</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">4.379310388184409</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:22113154:6:00783">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">22113154</data>
      <data key="d6">6</data>
      <data key="d7">RESULTS: Altogether, 138 patients (mean age: 36.3years, 65.7% male, 57.6% Caucasian, virtually all with schizophrenia spectrum diagnosis) underwent clozapine rechallenge after developing neutropenia (n=112), agranulocytosis (n=15), neuroleptic malignant syndrome (NMS) (n=5), myocarditis (n=4), pericarditis (n=1) and lupus erythematosus (n=1).</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">3.949862763670301</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:22113154:8:00784">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">22113154</data>
      <data key="d6">8</data>
      <data key="d7">Clozapine rechallenge was successful in 78/112 patients (69.6%, CI: 60.6-77.4) after neutropenia, 3/15 (20%, CI: 7.1-45.2) after agranulocytosis, 5/5 (100%, CI: 56-100) after NMS, 3/4 (75%, CI: 30-95) after myocarditis, 1/1 after pericarditis, and 0/1 after clozapine-induced lupus.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">4.379310388184409</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:22113154:8:00785">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">22113154</data>
      <data key="d6">8</data>
      <data key="d7">Clozapine rechallenge was successful in 78/112 patients (69.6%, CI: 60.6-77.4) after neutropenia, 3/15 (20%, CI: 7.1-45.2) after agranulocytosis, 5/5 (100%, CI: 56-100) after NMS, 3/4 (75%, CI: 30-95) after myocarditis, 1/1 after pericarditis, and 0/1 after clozapine-induced lupus.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
      <data key="d12">3.949862763670301</data>
    </node>
    <node id="evidence:22113154:11:00786">
      <data key="d1">evidence</data>
      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">22113154</data>
      <data key="d6">11</data>
      <data key="d7">CONCLUSIONS: Although controlled studies are clearly needed, using a priori, confidence interval-based criteria, case reports/series suggest that in refractory patients who benefited from clozapine, careful rechallenge can be considered after neutropenia and NMS, but not after agranulocytosis and myocarditis.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[{"kind": "speculation", "text": "suggest", "start": 133, "end": 140}]</data>
