      <data key="d3">27736047</data>
      <data key="d6">12</data>
      <data key="d7">There were fewer occurrences of mild neutropenia (ANC &lt; 2.0 × 10³ cells/mm³) after clozapine initiation than before (16.0% and 31.4%, respectively; P &lt; .001).</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
