      <data key="d3">27736047</data>
      <data key="d6">13</data>
      <data key="d7">There were also fewer occurrences of moderate neutropenia (ANC &lt; 1.5 × 10³ cells/mm³), with 2.1% after clozapine and 13.3% before (P &lt; .001).</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
