      <data key="d2">co_mention evidence</data>
      <data key="d3">9453932</data>
      <data key="d6">10</data>
      <data key="d7">Clozapine tolerance has shown it to be satisfactory, however we noticed the occurrence of a leucopenia with neutropenia after seventeen weeks of treatment, followed, some days later, by a Quincke oedema, which forced to interrupt the treatment.</data>
      <data key="d8">co_mention</data>
      <data key="d9">[]</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">case_study_lexicon_pair_scoped_rule_baseline</data>
