      <data key="d3">12506270</data>
      <data key="d6">2</data>
      <data key="d7">However, according to different epidemiological studies clozapine can induce neutropenia in less than 3% of patients and may represent a major problem for the management of treatment-resistant patients not responding to conventional or other atypical antipsychotics.</data>
      <data key="d8">speculative</data>
      <data key="d9">[{"type": "causal_wording", "text": "induce", "start": 70, "end": 76}]</data>
