      <data key="d3">12506270</data>
      <data key="d6">3</data>
      <data key="d7">Recently, a few case of neutropenia have been reported following the addition of other medications to clozapine, notably paroxetine, risperidone, trimethoprim-sulfamethoxazole and erythromycin.</data>
      <data key="d8">supported</data>
