      <data key="d7">INTRODUCTION AND OBJECTIVE: The frequency of agranulocytosis induced by psychoactive drugs is estimated the first year of around 0.8% under clozapine, against 0.13% under chlorpromazine (King and Wager, 1998 [3]).</data>
